namespace pdg { /**
\fn pdg::Serializer::serialize_mem(Uint8Array mem)
\brief Serialize bytes from a Uint8Array.

Node Buffer is also accepted. Only the view's bytes are serialized, respecting byteOffset and byteLength. The bytes are copied into serializer storage during this call; later source changes do not affect the stream. Strings and other typed-array element types are rejected.
\param mem The Uint8Array to serialize.
\see serialize_mem(MemBlock)
\see sizeof_mem(Uint8Array)
**/ }
